<div id="urduTextPath">امام محمد باقر (ع)/باقر بھی تھے شریک شہنشاہ تشنہ لب</div>

<p>baquar bhi the shareek-e shahinshaah-e tashnalab<br />
sehraa-e karbala me uthaate rahe ta'ab<br />
kam umr the to kya huwa majboor the ye kab<br />
zor-e jawaa'n dikhate jo hoti raza e rab</p>

<p>hamjoli unke kaise lade is ladaai me<br />
bachou ki dhaak bandh gayi tegh aazmaai me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>manzoor haq ko rakn-e imaamat ka tha qayaam<br />
daftar me ousiya ke raqam ho chuka tha naam<br />
tha hukm-e zuljalaal ye ho paanchwe imaam<br />
qaayam rahe shariyate paighambar-e anaam</p>

<p>dee'n imtehaane sabr buzurgou'n ki shaan se<br />
hujjat tamaam karke sidhaare jahaan se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hamd-e quda me kat-te rahe imtihaa'n ke din<br />
shaaker huwa qitaab-e shahinshaah-e ins-o jinn<br />
qayam the hilm-e shaah ke sab kork-o min<br />
har ranj me raha dil-e aagaah mutmaain</p>

<p>keena bhara huwa tha jo qalb-e hishaam me<br />
takleef di bulaa ke madine se shaam me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>paaband hukme haakim-e jaaber tha be adab<br />
qeemat se koi cheez na dete the hai ghazab<br />
faaqe se teen roz raha sarwar-e arab<br />
jis tarha karbala me uthaaya tha ye ta'ab</p>

<p>guzre the waa'n bhi itne hi din bhook pyaas me<br />
dil tha hujoom-o hasrath-o andoh-o yaas me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>baaqer ke waaste marazul mout tha wohi<br />
eeza-e saqt kul ke madadgaar ne sahi<br />
taqat na uthne ki shah-e zeejaah me rahi<br />
baqsha pisar ko aap ne roz-e yadullahi</p>

<p>sadma ajab tha jaafar-e saadiq ki jaan par<br />
jaari wasiyate huwi jis dam zabaan par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rone lagaa pisar jo suna ye kalaam -e yaas<br />
shah ne kaha quda ho nigahbaan na ho udaas<br />
rakha huwa hai jo mere ahraam ka libaas<br />
dena kafan usi se mujhe mera haq shinaas</p>

<p>nahlaana apne haath se aye mahjabee'n hame<br />
padhkar namaaz qabr me rakhna tumhi hame<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aawaaz deraha hai jigar gousha-e hussain<br />
aaja ke aaj quld me hai mera noor-e ain<br />
ye kahte kahte chup huwe sultaan-e mashraqain<br />
laqte jigar ne aah ki aaya na dil ka chain</p>

<p>dekha ke haal ghair hai shaah-e anaam ka<br />
qibla ki simth kardiya chehra imaam ka<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tha jinke saamne ruq-e farzand-e mahlaqaa<br />
aankhe'n wo band hogayi andher hogaya<br />
jo dil rubaa se kah rahe the dil ka mud'duaa<br />
qaamoosh wo zabaa'n aye waa musibataa</p>

<p>kya kya tha karb jis me basar teen din huwe<br />
bejaan chouthe roz shah-e ins-o jinn huwe<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>